  </section><section id="faq-1" class="section section-faq">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Orders &amp; Measurements FAQ</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list"><details id="faq-measure" class="faq-item card">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How do I send my measurements if I live outside Lagos?</span>
          <span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We send you a 2-minute video guide on WhatsApp. You can take measurements at home or with any local tailor and send them over.</p>
        </div>
      </details><details id="faq-time" class="faq-item card">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>What is your standard turnaround time?</span>
          <span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Standard orders take 7 to 10 working days. Rush orders (3 to 5 days) are available on request.</p>
        </div>
      </details><details id="faq-delivery" class="faq-item card">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Do you ship nationwide and internationally?</span>
          <span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes, we ship across Nigeria via GIG Logistics and internationally via DHL Express.</p>
        </div>
      </details></div>
    </div>
